{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "WEBSTER1833",
  "book_code": "NUM",
  "chapter": 26,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "NUM.26.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:NUM.26.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And it came to pass after the plague, that the LORD spoke to Moses, and to Eleazar the son of Aaron the priest, saying,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "NUM.26.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:NUM.26.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Take the sum of all the congregation of the children of Israel, from twenty years old and upward, throughout their fathers' house, all that are able to go to war in Israel.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "NUM.26.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:NUM.26.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Moses and Eleazar the priest spoke with them in the plains of Moab by Jordan ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "near",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " Jericho, saying,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "NUM.26.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:NUM.26.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Take the sum of the people",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", from twenty years old and upward; as the LORD commanded Moses and the children of Israel, who went forth from the land of Egypt.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "NUM.26.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:NUM.26.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Reuben the eldest son of Israel: the children of Reuben; Hanoch, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "of whom cometh",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the family of the Hanochites: Of Phallu, the family of the Phalluites:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "NUM.26.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:NUM.26.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Of Hezron, the family of the Hezronites: of Carmi, the family of the Carmites.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "NUM.26.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:NUM.26.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "These ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the families of the Reubenites: and they that were numbered of them were forty and three thousand and seven hundred and thirty.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "NUM.26.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:NUM.26.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the sons of Phallu; Eliab.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "NUM.26.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:NUM.26.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the sons of Eliab; Nemuel, and Dathan, and Abiram. This ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is that",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " Dathan and Abiram, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "who were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " famous in the congregation, who strove against Moses and against Aaron in the company of Korah, when they strove against the LORD:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "NUM.26.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:NUM.26.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the earth opened her mouth, and swallowed them up together with Korah, when that company died, when the fire devoured two hundred and fifty men: and they became a sign.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "NUM.26.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:NUM.26.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Notwithstanding the children of Korah died not.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "NUM.26.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:NUM.26.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The sons of Simeon after their families: of Nemuel, the family of the Nemuelites: of Jamin, the family of the Jaminites: of Jachin, the family of the Jachinites:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "NUM.26.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:NUM.26.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Of Zerah, the family of the Zarhites: of Shaul, the family of the Shaulites.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "NUM.26.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:NUM.26.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "These ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the families of the Simeonites, twenty and two thousand and two hundred.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "NUM.26.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:NUM.26.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The children of Gad after their families: of Zephon, the family of the Zephonites: of Haggai, the family of the Haggites: of Shuni, the family of the Shunites:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "NUM.26.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:NUM.26.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Of Ozni, the family of the Oznites: of Eri, the family of the Erites:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "NUM.26.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:NUM.26.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Of Arod, the family of the Arodites: of Areli, the family of the Arelites.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "NUM.26.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:NUM.26.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "These ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the families of the children of Gad, according to those that were numbered of them, forty thousand and five hundred.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "NUM.26.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:NUM.26.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The sons of Judah ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " Er and Onan: and Er and Onan died in the land of Canaan.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "NUM.26.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:NUM.26.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the sons of Judah after their families were; of Shelah, the family of the Shelanites: of Pharez, the family of the Pharezites: of Zerah, the family of the Zarhites.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "NUM.26.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:NUM.26.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the sons of Pharez were; of Hezron, the family of the Hezronites: of Hamul, the family of the Hamulites.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "NUM.26.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:NUM.26.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "These ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the families of Judah according to those that were numbered of them, seventy six thousand and five hundred.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "NUM.26.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:NUM.26.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Of",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the sons of Issachar after their families: ",
