        },
        {
          "text": " the sons of Naphtali after their families: of Jahzeel, the family of the Jahzeelites: of Guni, the family of the Gunites:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "NUM.26.49",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:NUM.26.49",
      "verse": 49,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Of Jezer, the family of the Jezerites: of Shillem, the family of the Shillemites.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "NUM.26.50",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:NUM.26.50",
      "verse": 50,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "These ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the families of Naphtali according to their families: and they that were numbered of them, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " forty and five thousand and four hundred.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "NUM.26.51",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:NUM.26.51",
      "verse": 51,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "These ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the numbered of the children of Israel, six hundred thousand and a thousand seven hundred and thirty.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "NUM.26.52",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:NUM.26.52",
      "verse": 52,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the LORD spoke to Moses, saying,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "NUM.26.53",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:NUM.26.53",
      "verse": 53,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "To these the land shall be divided for an inheritance, according to the number of names.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "NUM.26.54",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:NUM.26.54",
      "verse": 54,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "To many thou shalt give the more inheritance, and to few thou shalt give the less inheritance: to every one shall his inheritance be given, according to those that were numbered of him.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "NUM.26.55",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:NUM.26.55",
      "verse": 55,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Notwithstanding, the land shall be divided by lot: according to the names of the tribes of their fathers they shall inherit.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "NUM.26.56",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:NUM.26.56",
      "verse": 56,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "According to the lot shall the possession of it be divided between many and few.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "NUM.26.57",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:NUM.26.57",
      "verse": 57,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And these ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " they that were numbered of the Levites after their families: of Gershon, the family of the Gershonites: of Kohath, the family of the Kohathites: of Merari, the family of the Merarites.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "NUM.26.58",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:NUM.26.58",
      "verse": 58,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "These ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the families of the Levites: the family of the Libnites, the family of the Hebronites, the family of the Mahlites, the family of the Mushites, the family of the Korathites. And Kohath begat Amram.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "NUM.26.59",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:NUM.26.59",
      "verse": 59,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the name of Amram's wife ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " Jochebed, the daughter of Levi, whom ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "her mother",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " bore to Levi in Egypt: and she bore to Amram Aaron and Moses, and Miriam their sister.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "NUM.26.60",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:NUM.26.60",
      "verse": 60,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And to Aaron was born Nadab, and Abihu, Eleazar, and Ithamar.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "NUM.26.61",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:NUM.26.61",
      "verse": 61,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Nadab and Abihu died, when they offered strange fire before the LORD.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "NUM.26.62",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:NUM.26.62",
      "verse": 62,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And those that were numbered of them were twenty and three thousand, all males from a month old and upward: for they were not numbered among the children of Israel, because there was no inheritance given them among the children of Israel.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "NUM.26.63",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:NUM.26.63",
      "verse": 63,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "These ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " they that were numbered by Moses and Eleazar the priest, who numbered the children of Israel in the plains of Moab by Jordan ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "near",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " Jericho.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "NUM.26.64",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:NUM.26.64",
      "verse": 64,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But among these there was not a man of them whom Moses and Aaron the priest numbered, when they numbered the children of Israel in the wilderness of Sinai.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "NUM.26.65",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:NUM.26.65",
      "verse": 65,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For the LORD had said of them, They shall surely die in the wilderness. And there was not left a man of them, save Caleb the son of Jephunneh, and Joshua the son of Nun.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
